  "worked_solution": "We have $\\frac{1}{5}$ on the left and $\\frac{4}{5}$ on the right.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14129500/assets/e824516e780e3c9beaad8450db6b7ed9496d7c6046db9bfbc918e3179b4384b9.png)\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{5}\\times 4=\\frac{4}{5}.\n$$",
